; The Archmage (.ai/protagonist.md): the blue-robed figure in the ward on the title screen and in the prologue - the
; player, the one wizard the dark wizard did not take. Eric, 2026-11-02: "the fifth starting character - his starting
; tag alignment is arcane. If no one's starting spell is magic missile, that will be his", and he is first on the
; character select (CharacterRoster.SelectionOrder). A starter, so every save holds him (UnlockCatalog). He opens on
; Magic Missile, pure Arcane since the same day. His passive is Overlooked: once a run, the blow that would end him
; misses - he was missed once already. His sheet is tools/art/player_archmage.py, the title figure on the 48 cell.
